  "title": "Ricotta Apple Lasagna",
  "description": "Apples and cheese team up in this unusual dessert. Ricotta and cheddar cheese are sweetened with sugar, flavored with almond extract, then layered with noodles and apple pie filling and topped with an oatmeal crust. Serve warm with sweet sour cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Star Pooley"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-02-07T16:35:23-05:00",
